{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/602ff2da23599892afc90273a56e96d4.poster.avif?t=1769091557\" width=830 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/602ff2da23599892afc90273a56e96d4.webm?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/602ff2da23599892afc90273a56e96d4.mp4?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Kiipluu is a hardcore stealth adventure set in a brutal Neolithic world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Kiipluu, a young hunter fleeing across hostile lands while pursued by the cannibalistic Na\u2019ush. Outnumbered and under-equipped, you must rely on stealth, planning, and careful movement to survive. Direct combat is possible but always risky, always costly, and often a last resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/3193e1f7a8dc33145313d6087894527b.poster.avif?t=1769091557\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/3193e1f7a8dc33145313d6087894527b.webm?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/3193e1f7a8dc33145313d6087894527b.mp4?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is a tense survival puzzle. Study patrol routes, use tall grass, shadows, sound, and terrain to stay hidden. Set traps, strike from ambush, or slip past unseen. Being discovered can quickly become fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When stealth fails, combat is fast, brutal, and unforgiving. Weapons are primitive. Injuries matter. There are no easy victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/296dcd588f9a8418f390127d7e8c24fd.poster.avif?t=1769091557\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/296dcd588f9a8418f390127d7e8c24fd.webm?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/296dcd588f9a8418f390127d7e8c24fd.mp4?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, Kiipluu is haunted by dreamlike spirit journeys and visions of his father, a legendary hunter whose shadow looms over every choice. Your decisions shape who survives, who is lost, and what kind of person Kiipluu becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story of fear, survival, and growing up in a world that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/c764c7723a482982080489ea3f9551af.poster.avif?t=1769091557\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/c764c7723a482982080489ea3f9551af.webm?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/c764c7723a482982080489ea3f9551af.mp4?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore stealth</strong>-focused gameplay with high tension and lethal consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal, high-risk combat</strong> when avoidance is no longer possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constantly pursued</strong> by a relentless cannibal tribe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting and crafting</strong> to prepare tools, weapons, and survival gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark mythic narrative</strong> told through dream-journeys and spirit encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful choices</strong> that shape the journey and its outcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable on PC</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826710?t=1769091557","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/ae5ab1668062bc14f6fbcc695958ddadfbe467ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769091557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/0cf1b297e6fd897d8336c0e7a27a3b8251c17674/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769091557","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/0cf1b297e6fd897d8336c0e7a27a3b8251c17674/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769091557","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\