y become fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When stealth fails, combat is fast, brutal, and unforgiving. Weapons are primitive. Injuries matter. There are no easy victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/296dcd588f9a8418f390127d7e8c24fd.poster.avif?t=1769091557\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/296dcd588f9a8418f390127d7e8c24fd.webm?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/296dcd588f9a8418f390127d7e8c24fd.mp4?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, Kiipluu is haunted by dreamlike spirit journeys and visions of his father, a legendary hunter whose shadow looms over every choice. Your decisions shape who survives, who is lost, and what kind of person Kiipluu becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story of fear, survival, and growing up in a world that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/c764c7723a482982080489ea3f9551af.poster.avif?t=1769091557\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/c764c7723a482982080489ea3f9551af.webm?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/c764c7723a482982080489ea3f9551af.mp4?t=1769091557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_parag